# =====================================================================
# Dhathuru .gitignore
# Anything below must NEVER reach GitHub. Aiman commits by hand; this is
# the safety net. After editing, verify with:
#   git check-ignore -v datasets/MACL/Metadata.csv AGENTS.md .env
# =====================================================================

